Data
----
MaleCNS v1.0, the connectome of the adult male Drosophila central nervous system,
Janelia FlyEM (HHMI) and Google. Licensed CC-BY 4.0. https://male-cns.janelia.org
flycraft does not redistribute it: `flycraft prep-data` downloads it from the
FlyEM public bucket. Cite the dataset as its release page asks.

Model
-----
The leaky integrate-and-fire model, its equations and constants follow
Shiu, P.K., Sterne, G.R., Spiller, N. et al. "A Drosophila computational brain model
reveals sensorimotor processing." Nature 634, 210-219 (2024).
https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-024-07763-9
Code: https://github.com/philshiu/Drosophila_brain_model (no code is copied).

Methods we port ideas from (no code is copied)
----------------------------------------------
- doomfly (nftechie/doomfly), MIT: dopamine reward onto KC to MBON synapses.
- fruitfly-lab (webergithub/fruitfly-lab), MIT: the scrambled-wiring control and the
  LC10a, AOTU019, DNa02 steering circuit.
- drosophila-brain-mlx (kiminbean/drosophila-brain-mlx), MIT: MaleCNS loading
  conventions and reference counts.

